   "id": 543953,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The map of the states of Imaginaria is given. Use a graph to determine if it is possible to begin in one state, travel through Imaginaria crossing the border between each pair of states exactly once, and end in a different state. If it is possible, find such a route. If it is not, explain why.\n<br>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/6dee60e20259b9b4.png\" alt=\"A map of Imaginaria. It has four regions: Fictionville, Illusionham, Mythbury, and Pretendstead.\">\n",
